oar (2.6.0~rc1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

    * This version of OAR supports Cgroups v2 via Systemd. Please remove
      any kernel command line parameters previously added on OAR nodes to
      enable Cgroups v1.
    * E.g. on every nodes, edit /etc/default/grub, remove from GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX
      "systemd.unified_cgroup_hierarchy=false systemd.legacy_systemd_cgroup_controller=true",
      and finally run update-grub again. Then, reboot the nodes.

 -- Pierre Neyron <pierre.neyron@free.fr>  Sun, 26 Jan 2025 22:49:54 +0100
